<title>PORTUGAL: TAP-Air Portugal pilots to strike March 15.</title>
<headline>TAP-Air Portugal pilots to strike March 15.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilots of state airline TAP-Air Portugal plan to stage an overtime stoppage for an indefinite period from March 15, the Civil Aviation Pilots' Union said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The general assembly of the union decided to declare a strike from midnight GMT on March 15 for an indefinite period covering overtime and holiday periods,&quot; a statement said.</p>
<p>The union said it was protesting against demands by management to raise the retirement age for pilots to 65 from 60.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
